    <div class="eyebrow">Why the HBDI assessment</div>
    <h2 class="mt-0">A shared language for how your team thinks.</h2>
    <p>Our HBDI team building is tailored to your specific challenges and gives you insight into you and your team members&rsquo; thinking preferences &mdash; enabling more informed decisions and more confident leadership. Leadership teams draw immediate value from the session, because HBDI equips them with a new language to address both everyday issues and strategic direction.</p>
    <p>We&rsquo;re New York City based, but run HBDI sessions across the nation and in other countries. Over the last few years we&rsquo;ve refined the approach to deliver HBDI in an all-virtual session too &mdash; useful when speed matters and an in-person meeting isn&rsquo;t feasible.</p>
    <h3>About us</h3>
    <p>In the last 18 years we&rsquo;ve taken over <strong>2,000 individuals</strong> &mdash; leaders and experts &mdash; and more than <strong>250 teams</strong> through our HBDI assessment debrief. We&rsquo;re not HBDI salespeople; we deeply believe in the impact it has on a business. HBDI:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>supports an individual&rsquo;s self-awareness and growth</li>
      <li>dramatically improves team dynamics</li>
      <li>helps guide organizations through transformational change</li>
    </ul>
